   1542  3caf							; ------------------------------------------------------------ the dice (v0.22)
   1543  3caf							; SHIFT + /: each effect in DICE_FX (soundtab.asm) goes on with its chance and
   1544  3caf							; gets one of DICE_ROWS ready-made settings, or off. The tone, envelope,
   1545  3caf							; levels and octaves stay. The name gets a * at the end. C= + / undoes it.
